SUMMARY:Stand-Up Showcase
LOCATION:DC Improv\, 1140 Connecticut Avenue NW\, Washington
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy great stand-up comedy in downtown DC. Our showcase lineup
 s feature top talent from DC\, Maryland\, Virginia and beyond\, performing 
 on one of the country's most famous stages. You'll see a variety of styles 
 and get up close with some of the stars of tomorrow. Support local talent\,
  support local business and (most important) laugh your a** off. Showcases 
 generally last around 90 minutes.\n\nNovember 27-29 lineup: Ivi Demi\, Alex
  Castagne\, Eddie Morrison\, Rahmein Mostafavi\, Christine O'Dea\n\nDecembe
 r 4-6 lineup: Owen Vacheron\, Josh Ocean Thomas\, Gray West\, Jack Weiler\n
 \nDecember 11-13 lineup: Dom Grayer\, Matty Litwack\, Charles Engle\, Nick 
 Hopping\n\nAll sales are final. Refunds and exchanges are offered only when
  a show is canceled or rescheduled.\n\nAdmission Policies\n\nPatrons must b
 e 18 or older to attend events or classes at the DC Improv. Any exceptions 
 are clearly noted in the event descriptions.\n\nThere is a two-item minimum
  per customer. This can be any combination of food items or beverages. Bott
 led water and soft drinks count as items. (The two-item minimum does not ap
 ply to comedy classes.)\n\nCoupons or passes for free admission cannot be u
 sed for a show listed as a "special event."\n\nSeating Policies\n\nAll show
 s in our lounge showroom are seated by time of arrival. The earlier you arr
 ive\, the more options you'll have. Please note that the size of your party
  can affect what options are available to you\, as certain tables and areas
  are designated for larger parties.\n\nFor general admission tickets\, if y
 our party does not fill an entire table\, you may be sharing a table with o
 ther patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/stand-
 up-showcase-74975/
